# Core standards

- Keep diffs minimal; match existing patterns in the touched area.
- Never commit secrets or put server keys in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variables.
- Validate external input with Zod before services or repositories run.
- Prefer Server Actions and route handlers over client-side data fetching.
- Run `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm test` after behavior changes.
- Add or update tests when changing business logic or schemas.
- Document env var or architecture changes in `docs/` and `AGENTS.md`.
